WEBVTT

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.860
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.710
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:17.920
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:22.720
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:27.320
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.740
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:36.010
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.880
The narrow victory in the
seemingly hopeless battle...

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.670
with the demon dragon
Shooting Star has caused...

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:14.500
Flaim's royal castle of Akrohd
to be thrown into a joyous uproar.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:18.530
And news of the safe
return of King Kashue...

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:21.160
who had been given up
for dead was cause enough...

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.000
for the battle-weary soldiers
to forget for a moment...

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:29.960
the ominous events
brewing in Marmo.

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:56.650
Parn.

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:02.570
Sorry I woke you.

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:04.500
That's all right.

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:21.870
What's wrong?

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.480
Nothing.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.210
Parn.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:35.980
Thank you.

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:41.990
Sure.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.520
Were you with Parn?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:16.620
What's wrong?

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.070
That's what I
hate about you, Orson!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:24.670
You should know when to
talk about something else.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:28.080
How many years have
we been together?!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.090
Marmo?

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.530
Aye.

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:41.180
With Ashram dead...

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.320
we assumed it would revert
to just another dark land.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:47.840
How can I describe it?

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:50.910
It's as if the entire
island has come to life.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:51.600
What?

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:56.250
At times the earth shakes and
growls like some great beast.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.610
Even the creatures who
dwell there seem to be afraid.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.020
Afraid...?

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:50.370
I'm...?!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:58.180
Is a man's path in life
ever really of his choosing?

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.090
Who's there?!

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:10.480
The elf only existed to allow
you to fulfill your purpose.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:11.600
My purpose?

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:15.000
Do you truly wish to
end up as Wagnard's puppet?

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:15.850
What...?!

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:21.070
Wagnard has no intention
of following you.

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:23.240
That comes as no surprise.

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:25.170
The Scepter of Domination.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:26.860
What do you think
his <i>real</i> use for it shall be?

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:35.830
I imagine even Kardis
would have to submit to it.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.080
Who the devil are you?!

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.600
Soul Crusher.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:52.250
It would appear
you've mastered it.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.600
But will it serve
you against Kardis?

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.310
What?!

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.600
The boy known as Parn...

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:03.100
He will surely come
to Marmo as well.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:04.110
Parn.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.120
You?!

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:12.420
Return to Marmo.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:15.940
All Lodoss must now
go there as well.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:40.740
Go to Moss?

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:43.830
You want me to carry
this letter to them?

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:46.130
Shadam will be
riding for Raiden.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:48.820
We must gather all of Lodoss'
forces for this task.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:52.820
The Marmo have the Scepter
of Domination, don't they?

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.320
"Scepter of Domination?"

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:01.330
Whoever holds the
Scepter holds Lodoss.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.490
Gimme a break! With Beld and
Ashram dead, there's no one left!

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:06.540
No.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.850
There's something
else afoot here.

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:12.550
Something is
happening on Marmo.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:16.720
You're saying we have to gather
the island's scattered forces?

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.060
Count me out!
Sounds like a load of bull to me!

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:26.000
I've heard legends that say
Kardis sleeps beneath Marmo.

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:30.070
Kardis the Destroyer?!

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:39.230
You're saying Kardis is
being resurrected on Marmo?!

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:41.320
Once she is
it'll be too late!

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:47.020
Deed?

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:16.320
So, this is the
Scepter of Domination.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:24.070
With this, not even Kardis'
power can stand before me!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:29.340
Now Lodoss will
be yours to control.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:45.070
Creator of all things, mighty
power emerging from chaos.

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:48.540
Made incarnate and
empowered by the gods.

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:56.340
Reveal your true form
and become my shield.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.010
Kardis.
No need to be impatient.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:05.910
The time draws near.
And after that...

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:14.570
Lord Wagnard!

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:37.240
Come.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:45.240
You should save those feelings
of concern for Lodoss.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:47.750
Leylia.

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:51.960
I really should be
traveling there alone.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:55.750
But Slayn, I'm glad
you're here with me.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:59.700
Were the situation
not so grave...

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:02.760
I'd be able to say
the many things I'd like to.

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:05.510
Slayn.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:18.360
Slayn!

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:22.260
It couldn't be.

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.090
Here we part company.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.930
Don't get your hopes up
about Raiden.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.270
A free city with no leader...

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:48.920
They couldn't care less about
outsiders or other kingdoms.

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:52.900
They aren't outsiders!
Raiden's part of Lodoss, too.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:56.610
Listen, if someone isn't
a threat, they're an outsider.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:59.110
Is that how mercenaries
like you see things?

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:02.900
Hell yeah! That's why
we're bowing out of this job.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:04.110
Right, Orson?

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:07.290
Go where you will, but
so long as you oppose Marmo...

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:09.080
our paths will
surely cross again.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.550
I pray you safe passage.

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:14.830
Bye!

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:17.920
Shirts!

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:21.090
Thanks for everything!

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.480
It's up to you.

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:39.520
Highness.

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:44.570
Our border forces should
be assembled here soon.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.880
Whoa!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:01.640
What's wrong?

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.860
Are you still
upset about Shirts?

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:06.930
Of course not.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:08.930
Then what's wrong?

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:12.140
Deed?

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.580
The Marmo will need me.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:22.940
Not me so much as my powers
as a High Elf.

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:34.960
Marmo. The Scepter of
Domination. And me...

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:38.250
I don't know who's
behind all this...

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:43.710
but I've a feeling
I know what's happening.

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:45.720
Deed.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:47.720
Parn.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.610
I've found you, High Elf.

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:15.650
The sky looks strange.
That's where Parn was headed.

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:20.630
Who are you?!

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:26.650
My name is Wagnard.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:30.640
Though soon you
will call me God!

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.140
What?!

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:33.640
Kardis!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.140
What did you say?!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.530
Parn, no! You can't
defeat him with a sword!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:15:00.540
Baylos, almighty power of
fiery destruction, come forth!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:08.970
Friend Undine, spirit of water.
Lend us your power!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:21.730
No mere elemental
can defeat me!

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:47.890
Enough of this farce.

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.190
Deed, run for it!

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:04.440
Parn!

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:19.290
PARN!

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:30.340
Deed!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.090
Fool.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:43.100
I won't let you...
take Deed...!

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:47.500
Deed...! I'll save...!!!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.040
Farewell.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.970
Deed.

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:23.430
Shirts! Take cover!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.230
But...!

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.400
Deed.

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:31.280
Don't worry yourself.

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:34.800
You're all right now, Parn.

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:38.350
Etoh's treatment alone
wasn't enough to save you.

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:40.300
Slayn?!

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:45.810
Deed! Where's Deed?!

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.020
Don't push yourself.

00:18:56.020 --> 00:19:00.860
Deed! If I don't get her back,
that wizard will...!

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.190
Parn! Be still!

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:04.570
But...!

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:08.830
Do you know how much power she
used to gather those light elementals?!

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:12.500
The light she gave
to your father's sword...

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.840
is what led us all to you.

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:23.310
The one who took her away
was probably Wagnard.

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:24.940
Wagnard...?

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.410
The eternal life of a High Elf.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:31.850
Such power would be needed
to resurrect the dark goddess.

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:35.860
Use Deed's life
to revive Kardis?!

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:44.870
Deed... Deed!

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:54.380
Deed!

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:13.800
Where are you going
without even a sword?

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:20.310
Gotta death wish
all of a sudden?

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:25.990
And what about that letter
Kashue gave you to deliver?!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.890
For crying out loud!

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:33.030
We'll take it to Moss.

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:34.050
Orson!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:38.740
I think Shirts was thinking
of doing it already.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:41.010
Orson.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:44.780
You think my pal and I
aren't right for the job?

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:49.780
Listen, just don't die
before we see you again!

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:06.700
Guys.

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:10.020
As bull-headed
as always, I see.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:13.710
Parn, Princess Fianna
wants you to have this.

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:16.320
That's...

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.630
King Fahn's sword.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:19.460
Etoh.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:22.710
She thought it was only
right that you carry it.

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:00.960
To Marmo, then.

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:16.690
Beld is no more.
Fahn is no more.

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:21.130
Within this chaos, who shall be
the one to gain control of Lodoss?

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:27.030
Even now, the full might of Lodoss
moves towards a final battle...

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:30.550
with the forces of Darkness
on the island of Marmo!

00:22:32.490 --> 00:22:39.040
And is there still a chance for
Ashram's ambitions to be realized?!

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:55.580
Beneath Marmo lies the
legendary altar of the dark goddess.

00:22:55.580 --> 00:22:56.960
Within these depths...

00:22:56.960 --> 00:23:00.540
Deed's life will be
sacrificed to revive Kardis.

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:03.570
Saving Deed means
saving Lodoss itself.

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:07.540
Deed, wait for me!
I'll rescue you or die trying!

00:23:08.100 --> 00:23:10.110
Next time,
on Record of Lodoss War:

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:14.050
Episode 12 - "Final Battle!
Marmo - The Dark Island"

00:23:14.050 --> 00:23:16.800
I will defend the peace
of Lodoss with my life!
